      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "verso, right",
          "value": "<p></p>\n\n<ol><li>..........</li>\n<li>Expended</li>\n<li>on [\u2026]</li>\n<li>[the] elder [\u2026]</li>\n<li>---------</li>\n<li>[[a Euro[pe]an (living) in the synagogue]] 2</li>\n<li>---------</li>\n<li>[[the children of the wif[e of \u2026]]</li>\n<li>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 five</li>\n<li>[.]b[\u2026]</li>\n<li>[\u2026]</li>\n<li>[[[the] orphan via a payment order (ruq\u02bfa)]]</li>\n<li>---------</li>\n<li>[[my master]] 6 [[\u1e24as\u016bna]] 2</li>\n<li>---------</li>\n<li>[[a scribe from R\u016bm]] 2</li>\n<li>---------</li>\n<li>---------</li>\n<li>[[the female agent]] 2</li>\n<li>---------</li>\n<li>[[a poor/weak errand boy who arrived]] in\u00a0</li>\n<li>the evening and whose overcoat was taken from him</li>\n<li>as collateral for 5 dir(hems);</li>\n<li>his name is Abu\u2019l-Mun\u0101</li>\n<li>and he is sick\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 [[Ma\u02bf\u0101l\u012b 4]]</li></ol>\n",
