      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "verso, left",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>an acquaintance of the parnas</li>\n<li>---------</li>\n<li>[[b. Sabar\u0101]] 4</li>\n<li>Ma\u02bf\u0101l\u012b the porter in Cairo</li>\n<li>Ya\u02bfq\u016bb the Maghrebi four dir(hems)</li>\n<li>five</li>\n<li>Mu\u02beammala, a widow</li>\n<li>&ldquo;[c]oncealed&rdquo; who has never, ever</li>\n<li>taken anything 5</li>\n<li>---------</li>\n<li>the elder from Jerusalem 10</li>\n<li>the brother of b. \u02bfAl\u012b ten dir(hems)</li>\n<li>b. Ya\u1e25y\u0101 2 (+) ten dir(hems)</li>\n<li>the female beadle of the Palestinian synagogue of and her mother</li>\n<li>four dir(hems)</li>\n<li>---------</li>\n<li>[[Far\u0101\u1e25]] 6</li>\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Also through orders of payment</li>\n<li>Ya\u02bfaqov the Maghrebi 5 Mu\u02bfammala 5</li>\n<li>[&hellip;] 2 the man from J[eru]salem 10</li>\n<li>Umm Shalom 4 [the b]r[other] of b. \u02bfAl\u012b [10]</li>\n<li>[&hellip;] orphan 6 [b. Ya]\u1e25y\u0101 12</li>\n<li>\u1e24as\u016bna 2 [the female] beadle of the Palestinian synagogue [4]</li>\n<li>a scribe 2</li>\n<li>the female agent 2</li>\n<li>the poor errand boy 5</li>\n<li>b. Sabar\u0101 4</li>\n<li>Ma\u02bf\u0101l\u012b 4</li></ol>\n",
